## Quick Monitor Setup (for AI Agents)
- [Quick Monitor Setup guide](https://uptimerobot.com/quick-monitor-setup): Create a forever free 5-minute interval HTTPS monitor for a user with only the email where the notifications shall go, no registration or API key. The owner confirms with one click in an activation email.
- [GET /agentic/agent-monitor/challenge](https://api.uptimerobot.com/agentic/agent-monitor/challenge): Request a proof-of-work challenge with query params email and url; returns nonce, timestamp, difficulty, signature.
- [POST /agentic/agent-monitor](https://api.uptimerobot.com/agentic/agent-monitor): Submit the monitor as JSON {email, url, nonce, timestamp, counter, signature} with the solved challenge; returns HTTP 200 uniformly.
- [GET /agentic/agent-monitor/activate](https://api.uptimerobot.com/agentic/agent-monitor/activate): Render the owner's confirmation page (query param token).
- [POST /agentic/agent-monitor/activate](https://api.uptimerobot.com/agentic/agent-monitor/activate): Confirm activation (query param token); creates the account and monitor.

